# ChipSim data tree — build-plan S7.
#
# ChipSim never redistributes DrugBank. Bulk data lands under data/, is
# DVC-tracked, and is git-ignored. What MUST stay tracked is everything that
# makes the snapshot recoverable, auditable and attributable: the .dvc pointers,
# the .gitkeep anchors, the processed-artifact digests, and the human-authored
# provenance artifacts (T1/T2).
#
# NOTE ON ORDERING — this is the bug the first draft had. `data/raw/*` excludes
# the DIRECTORY data/raw/drugbank/, and git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded. That silently git-ignored T1/T2's provenance.yaml and
# T3/T4's SHA256SUMS.json, both of which the plan requires to be git-tracked.
# The directory negations below MUST precede the file negations.

data/raw/**
data/interim/**
data/processed/**

# Keep directories traversable so the file negations below can fire.
!data/raw/**/
!data/interim/**/
!data/processed/**/

# The files that must stay tracked.
!data/**/*.dvc
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/raw/drugbank/provenance.yaml
!data/raw/drugbank/PROVENANCE.md
!data/raw/drugbank/SHA256SUMS.json
!data/processed/*.sha256
